Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The Green Dolphin Street\NPenitentiary, a .k .a. The Aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.60,0:00:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mystery and Power were both\Nbirthed here at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.06,0:00:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Something which no ordinary people\Ncan see, and for those who can,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the Mystery and Power were both\Nbirthed here at some point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,remain foggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.56,0:00:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene received an additional\Nfive years for attempting to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,escape and has been in the\Npunishment cell for a few weeks now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.74,0:00:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.56,0:00:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,start after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.47,0:00:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.39,0:00:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But before that happens,\Nthere's something else I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.06,0:00:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to look into.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.24,0:00:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's another prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.66,0:01:02.48,Default,,0,0,0,,One that goes by the\Nname of Hermes Costello.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my understanding that she\Nand Jolene have already met.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.40,0:01:13.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.82,0:01:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.70,0:01:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The medical board?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.98,0:01:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.14,0:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.18,0:02:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.44,0:02:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,play,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.35,0:02:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.06,0:02:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Shotsieve I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.34,0:02:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,dream I don't want to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.06,0:02:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Be free. Break out. We\Ndon't want to. When I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,McDonald's. Break out. The\Nhabit of puedo. And definitely
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.34,0:02:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eye-t
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.24,0:02:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,awakened
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't stop beating,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.50,0:02:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,don't stop beating,\Ndon't stop beating a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.17,0:03:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,But the wound has practically disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have been dreaming?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.86,0:03:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, don't get ahead of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.92,0:03:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember it's coming back to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A five-year sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in custody for burglary, waiting\Nto be transferred to this prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.54,0:03:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I picked that thing up in the meeting
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,room in the jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.19,0:03:41.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it just sitting there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But knowing my luck, I cut my hand pretty\Nbad on it, which totally pissed me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.06,0:03:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.12,0:03:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that woman's name?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gwess. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I sold that thing to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.24,0:03:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And that night, I somehow passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.58,0:03:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.34,0:04:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.44,0:04:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Have I really been sleeping since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:05.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And my wound is mostly healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.10,0:04:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm. Hey, what's the\Ndeal with this sticker?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh i already peeled off the sticker\Nthat was on the palm of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Am i remembering this correctly in\N1492 columbus sailed the ocean blue?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.48,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bug's Bunny's birthday is July\N27th, 1940. I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.04,0:04:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd already thrown it away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.14,0:04:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.66,0:04:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My shoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.58,0:04:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Something seems different.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.60,0:04:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But what...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's one, two...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.34,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,There's three, four, five, and six...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.52,0:04:57.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.94,0:04:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, now there are five again!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.96,0:05:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It went back to normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.02,0:05:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Did...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.93,0:05:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,did the high fever cause\Nastigmatism in my eyes?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's that sticker.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the sticker that I just took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.36,0:05:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.46,0:05:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's nasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.60,0:05:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why don't you pipe down, new meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.40,0:05:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, don't mind me. Back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You moron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this is definitely not an\Nastigmatism from having a high fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:32.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm definitely touching it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel the weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.54,0:05:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Wherever I place it, it creates\Nan exact duplicate of the object.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I peel it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It causes damage as the\Ntwo merge back into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.80,0:05:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And this sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It sounds insane,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm certain it emerged from inside\Nof my body, from the cut on my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.74,0:06:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, once I accept this new\Nreality, it may come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.86,0:06:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Guccio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.34,0:06:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in overthinking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.64,0:06:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I just have to come to terms with the fact\Nthat the sticker comes out of my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me back my money, you rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.66,0:06:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.59,0:06:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell? Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.44,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.35,0:06:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,he just walked away from here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's trying to pretend\Nthat nothing happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.42,0:06:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I snagged this without thinking,\Nbecause it was right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.26,0:06:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that I have this thing,\Nwhat is it? What's it do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you managed\Nto break your fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.30,0:07:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're clear to return\Nto general population.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.44,0:07:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,That nighttime janitor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.96,0:07:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is he an upstanding prisoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The doctor has better\Nthings to do with this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Bait it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.18,0:07:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Who, the night janitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell would I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.42,0:07:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't know him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks like a CD, some kind of disc,\Nbased on its shape and the way it shines.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never seen a disc that\Nwas squishy and elastic like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.12,0:07:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, there was another one\Nof these sticking out of his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That makes two discs in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.12,0:07:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.03,0:07:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see something inside of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.34,0:07:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now the money that I took from\Nthat sick prisoner is all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.58,0:07:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.82,0:07:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I've hidden $5,000 and nobody has a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.78,0:07:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.88,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,McQueen, my child, do you think you\Ncan lend me a hand with something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.32,0:08:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,A little something between friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.40,0:08:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did that thing just show me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It was like I was\Nwatching someone's memory!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.36,0:08:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So, word's gotten round.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.02,0:08:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been asking\Npeople all about me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.38,0:08:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I have prior experience in\Nstalking, but I've got to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been stalked by a woman before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.94,0:08:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.22,0:08:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.20,0:08:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you eject some\Ndiscs out of your face?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Discs.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.52,0:08:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.46,0:08:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.70,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.32,0:08:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.30,0:09:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, why'd you bust out\Ncrying all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.44,0:09:05.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You took money from me while I was unconscious\Nin sickbay this morning, stupid ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.72,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.63,0:09:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.80,0:09:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I had thousands of dollars\Nstashed away in a safe place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but now I have no memory of anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, are you sure you're\Nall right there, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.72,0:09:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You better not be messing with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.16,0:09:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you just ask me if I'm all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.56,0:09:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.44,0:09:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been forever since the last\Ntime I spoke with a woman. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.06,0:09:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's my first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.04,0:09:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My first time to have a\Nheart-to-heart conversation with
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.72,0:09:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,a woman as staggeringly beautiful\Nas you are and very happy, honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.54,0:09:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Someday I hope to meet\Na girl like you and get
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.86,0:09:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,the chance to live\Nhappily together with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.44,0:09:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.35,0:09:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, that won't happen\Nbecause I'm a pathetic loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.96,0:09:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And why would you want someone like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.58,0:09:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's also pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.88,0:09:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.36,0:10:00.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.82,0:10:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you think you're doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.98,0:10:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.92,0:10:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.52,0:10:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.54,0:10:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, McQueen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.84,0:10:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You are truly evil in a\Nmisanthrope, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.72,0:10:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You worm your way through\Nthis world with no animosity,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and worst of all, you don't even think\Nyou're causing anyone any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.50,0:10:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You also insist on playing the victim,\Nalthough you have no interest in others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hoping that someone will come\Nalong one of these days and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.86,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're what's referred to in certain\Ncircles as the worst dragging others down
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,with your misfortune is a truly evil\Napproach which makes me have to say I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.94,0:10:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,quite fond of you McQueen if you were\Nto come across my enemy when you're
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.92,0:11:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,moving about this prison you'd be sure\Nto get rid of them for me like a true Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.02,0:11:03.85,Default,,0,0,0,,friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.93,0:11:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't that right, McQueen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.68,0:11:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Belt is around his neck,\Nand this around mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.00,0:11:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me, please, somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.04,0:11:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm passing out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.40,0:11:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe if I can bring him down,\Nhis power will release me as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticker!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.18,0:11:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a strange ability like mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.60,0:11:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That means I wasn't the only one. Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.72,0:11:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.04,0:11:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd you hang yourself like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.86,0:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really just help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.68,0:11:52.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.74,0:11:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real lifesaver.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you\Nthink you are, asshole?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.30,0:12:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And why the hell do you keep\Ndragging me into your problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You have some power too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.66,0:12:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't lie to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.98,0:12:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,My power. I don't know what you're\Ntalking about, but that'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't ever do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.62,0:12:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fully awake now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.32,0:12:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I really owe you everything\Nfor saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.56,0:12:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear I'll repay you\Nfor your kindness one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.50,0:12:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh I couldn't just sit\Nback and let you do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,about the scars
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.84,0:12:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,on his wrist.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.75,0:12:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's tried to commit suicide\Nbefore and I don't think
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,he's realized his ability\Naffects those around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.66,0:12:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet he's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.18,0:12:47.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My posture is even the same as his.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh God, I drifted even\Nfurther away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.38,0:12:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You dumb jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:12:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The disc.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.70,0:13:12.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what any of this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.48,0:13:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But it must have something\Nto do with that disc!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Please let me die.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I would pay you back, but a piece\Nof trash like me can't do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.96,0:13:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I want\Nto do is be your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.36,0:13:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never save your life again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.98,0:13:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, you come near me\Nagain, I'll kill you myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.56,0:13:33.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just kill me already.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was going to be Vernon, I'd\Nwant it to be someone like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:46.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I just saw her pull a\Ndisc out of the toilet bowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,For some reason, I feel\Nlike that belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Will she give it back to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.52,0:14:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,She probably won't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.46,0:14:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.46,0:14:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My discharge permit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.12,0:14:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me through!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.96,0:14:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get as far away from\Nthat guy as I possibly can.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.28,0:14:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I should get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Back to my cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.00,0:14:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your power has awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.02,0:14:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I can explain these new abilities to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What you have is called a stand power.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand wielders are drawn\Nto each other like magnets.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a part of the whole phenomenon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's sure why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.76,0:14:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's why you met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.54,0:14:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That sad janitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.42,0:14:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what's a kid doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I'm mistaken, you're the\None who sold Jolene's pendant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.04,0:14:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.60,0:14:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She asked me to keep an eye on you\Nin case anything suspicious happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.12,0:14:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Jolene, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did she get mixed up in all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.38,0:15:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The villain who steals people's hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's an enemy to both myself and Jolene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.74,0:15:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,We're searching for\Nthe hearts he's stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stolen heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.10,0:15:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The one responsible\Nfor this is Pale Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.36,0:15:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you know anything about\Nit, I ask you to help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.52,0:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,These stolen hearts is\Nthis disc what you're
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.18,0:15:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,talking about is that it\Ncame out of that janitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.26,0:15:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should start\Nwith what this thing is
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,hold on didn't he have\Ntwo discs another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.10,0:15:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah you're right\Nmemory disc and stand disc
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.18,0:15:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,it comes in a set of two\Ntwo discs make a single
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.76,0:15:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Soul. If we can track\Ndown the second one, we
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.54,0:15:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,might be able to find out\Nwho's behind pale snake?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be there's no way\Nis that jerk still trying
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.38,0:15:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,to mess with me this is crazy\Ni ran so Far away from him
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.12,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,no what's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.02,0:16:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,happening it's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:08.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Electricity. Their rotten pastor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.52,0:16:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,janitor must be electrocuting\Nhimself. It's over. I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.46,0:16:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,think he's done you can't\Nkill a human being just by
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.56,0:16:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending a hundred volts of\Nelectricity onto their exposed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.00,0:16:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,skin that's not how it works\NIt's all due to electrical
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,resistance that's why it stopped\Nhe failed to kill himself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.30,0:16:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,However if he's still planning\Nto try electrocuting himself
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.48,0:16:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Again, then I'm thinking: He's\Nprobably looking for salt water.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,With salt water, the current\Nconductivity will be almost 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.62,0:16:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Electricity can pierce and burn the\Nheart completely at those levels.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They use salt water for IVs and a\Nbunch of other healthcare stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There's plenty of it\Ndown in the medical wing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.56,0:16:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't go any further than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.54,0:16:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,There are too many other prisoners\Nroaming that floor right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:17:03.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta beat his ass unconscious and\Ntake out the other disc when it ejects!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.36,0:17:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my only chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.04,0:17:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa! Hold on! Just listen! Take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.08,0:17:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You see what's happened to my left arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.46,0:17:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's burnt and cut, just like your arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.94,0:17:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you starting to get the picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but you\Nhave a strange ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,where whatever injuries you sustain\Nwhile trying to offer yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,the same injuries happen to me, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.62,0:17:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,So stop thinking about suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.96,0:17:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure things will turn around\Nwith good times waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Four years ago, I was just\Ndoing some cleaning. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in my apartment,\Ncleaning and oiling my shotgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.94,0:17:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, a shell had gotten\Nitself stuck in the gun's barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.28,0:17:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.90,0:18:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My room was on the 10th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.36,0:18:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's when a woman jumped from the 11th\Nfloor in an attempt to kill herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.22,0:18:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a matter of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,People win millions in the lottery, so\Nobviously the opposite has to happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:18.12,Default,,0,0,0,,She was supposed to hit the\Nground and die from suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.84,0:18:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.08,0:18:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone assumes that I shot and\Nkilled that woman up on the 11th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The judge even called me cold-hearted\Nbefore he threw the book at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the man you've\Nseen before you! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.80,0:18:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You like panties, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.34,0:18:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Has anyone ever given you a pair?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.24,0:18:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If a cute girl were to give you her\Npanties, you'd feel lucky, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.08,0:18:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.30,0:18:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, you're going through\Nsome tough times right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.82,0:18:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you were given\Nfreshly worn panties,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.04,0:18:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and that means your luck\Ncan change for the better,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,even at the worst of times, when things\Nseem their darkest, don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.98,0:18:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.89,0:18:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,How embarrassing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.16,0:18:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll give them to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.72,0:18:56.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The actual pair I'm\Nwearing right this second!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You really want to give them to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.78,0:19:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.88,0:19:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a promise, didn't I? But listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody hates when the weekend is over\Nand Monday's right around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.04,0:19:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we all think a fun\NSaturday is waiting for me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.64,0:19:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,at the other end of this\Ntunnel and live our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.80,0:19:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,because we know it's not\Nalways going to be a Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The day I got arrested was a Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.38,0:19:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're saying something good that\Ngives me courage, which I appreciate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.78,0:19:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But maybe you're using\Nall those fine-sounding
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,words because you're\Ntrying to save yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.67,0:19:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.16,0:19:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,See, you're acting like you care,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.72,0:19:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're actually just trying\Nto calm me down for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.82,0:19:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The words you speak are\Nnot sincere, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.38,0:19:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's how you treat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.08,0:19:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have known\Nthis all from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.90,0:19:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No one wants to be with Trash,\Nbut I'm worse than Trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.76,0:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My presence is invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.74,0:19:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't even find me\Nto throw me away properly!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.62,0:19:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.53,0:19:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Pump the brakes, man. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:20:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that the only reason I talk\Nto you is because I want to survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.60,0:20:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.51,0:20:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to make you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This pale snake son of a\Nbitch is only using you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.86,0:20:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's taking advantage\Nof your broken heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.04,0:20:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you stop thinking about\Nsuicide, nothing will happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.90,0:20:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't have power over you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe then you'll stop thinking\Nonly about your damn self!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.60,0:20:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is exactly what\Nyou need, you shit stain!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.02,0:20:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.42,0:20:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.48,0:20:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your heart spoke to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You have me feeling so inspired now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.62,0:20:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It really shows a guy\Njust how lucky he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.56,0:20:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting the chance to meet an amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,person such as yourself\Nright before the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.60,0:20:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that, I'd like to thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.10,0:20:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I can make sure to die with you,\Nthen we can stay together forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.86,0:20:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I never realized Please,\NI can't be so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.42,0:20:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That evil little prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.40,0:20:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He really has to be the most lonesome,\Ncorrupt son of a bitch I've ever met.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.28,0:21:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna be lonely anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.66,0:21:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about\Nhitting that button!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That was too close, that damned idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.98,0:21:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to put a sticker on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.80,0:21:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The sparks from the\Nelectricity should burn it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.54,0:21:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And when the sticker is burned off,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,then the object that the sticker split\Nin two is going to merge back together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, the shock made me remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.82,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This moron hid a bunch of\Nmoney around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Five grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.68,0:21:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that money as\Npayment, you asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.20,0:22:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And as for you, pale snake, I\Nsuffered a lot because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.44,0:22:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you scheming?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.42,0:22:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got questions, Jolene Cujoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.62,0:22:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Of some place
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.22,0:22:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,other than here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.52,0:22:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Although you think I smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.74,0:22:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside and all the while
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.06,0:23:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wondering about my destiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.00,0:23:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.00,0:23:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,about all the
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,things I'd like
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to do in my life.
